   "text": "CHOSEN ✓\nCONSTRUCTION-LABELED GOLD SET (600)\nLabels are fixed FIRST, text is generated\nto match → truth guaranteed BY CONSTRUCTION.\nDeep research confirmed: no public alternative;\nIntercom uses the same paradigm internally.",
