   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3 PILLARS (the test of every decision):\n1) Label validity — is the label\n   actually correct?\n2) Difficulty/coverage — is the test as\n   hard as reality?\n3) No circularity — is anyone grading\n   their own homework?",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
