   "text": "CHOSEN ✓\nTWO STAGES: extract → draft\n1) Structured extraction: language, category,\n   priority, summary + per-field confidence\n2) Draft in the customer's language (built on\n   the classification)\nIndependent eval per stage; re-draft after\ncorrections; separate model choice possible.",
