   "text": "CHOSEN ✓\nCALIBRATED THRESHOLD + HUMAN SEND BUTTON\nConfidence calibration is MEASURED (ECE,\nreliability diagram); the threshold comes from\nthe automation-accuracy sweep; min(category,\npriority) confidence < threshold → manual\nreview. Drafts are NEVER auto-sent.",
