   "text": "CHOSEN ✓\nMATRIX + COST FUNCTION\ncost/ticket = API + P(review)·c₁ + P(auto∧wrong)·c₂\nsubject to an accuracy floor.\nCandidates: haiku-4.5 / gpt-5-mini / gemini-flash\n(council: start cheap, premium must earn it).\nSeparate decision per stage.",
