   "text": "CHOSEN ✓\nSPLIT DISCIPLINE + LLM COUNCIL\n· dev 150 (iteration) / selection 300 (frozen\n  prompt) / holdout 150 (ONCE)\n· Disjoint roles: generator Grok ≠ candidates\n  ≠ judge DeepSeek\n· Big decisions: council (cross-family anonymous\n  peer ranking + chairman synthesis) —\n  cross-family DISAGREEMENT = signal.",
